# Build context of the website image (apps/web/Dockerfile), which builds from the
# repository root because it needs packages/common as well as apps/web. The API and
# admin images build from their own folders, with their own .dockerignore.
*
!apps/web
!packages/common
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/.next
apps/web/.env*
packages/common/node_modules
**/*.log
